extends RefCounted

# Survey-backed card ratings used only for bot Reinforcement (sideboard)
# decisions between best-of-three games.
#
# Data provenance: "Bot ladder card audit (snapshot 2026-11-22 03:22 UTC)"
# (scripts/tmp/bot_ladder_card_audit_report.md), section 3 "Overall card
# success rates (min 400 games)". Values are the report's "Δ field" column —
# the win rate of decks containing the card minus the 49.6% field baseline —
# expressed in tenths of a percent (Berserker Mead +5.6% -> 56).
#
# Scope: ratings decide which unprotected main-deck cards a bot cuts to make
# room for matchup hate. They never influence in-game play, and they never
# override a positive hate-need score. Unrated cards default to 0 (field
# average), so they sit in the middle of the cut order rather than being
# treated as automatically bad.
